Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:51.03,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}好想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:56.66,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}たとえば　きみと僕を二つ足してさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:56.66,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}如果有一种魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:01:00.75,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}はんぶんこにちぎる魔法があれば
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:01:00.75,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}可以将你我相融再一分为二
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:03.88,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}サヨナラのない永遠になれるのかな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:03.88,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}是否就可以不再道别互为永远了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.88,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみがいないのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.88,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日你将不在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.92,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕は後悔するのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.92,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我定会追悔莫及
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:13.22,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}言えなかった言葉たちが
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:13.22,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}那些我欲言无声的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:15.93,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}棘になって刺さるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:15.93,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}也会化作荆棘刺向我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:19.18,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみがいないのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:19.18,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日你将不在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:22.35,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕はどうなっちゃうんだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:22.35,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我到底会变成什么模样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:25.57,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}そんな事考えてたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:25.57,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}越是想着这些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.61,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたくなったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.61,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}就对你越发思念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:31.91,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと生きれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:31.91,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日我能与你共度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:35.03,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}毎日記念日にして祝おう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:35.03,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我将把每一天都当做纪念日去庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:38.12,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}あたりまえにある奇跡を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:38.12,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}为了不忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:41.25,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}決して忘れはしないように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:41.25,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}这理所当然的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:44.25,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと生きれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:44.25,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日能与你共度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:47.50,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと話せるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:47.50,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日能与你同语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:50.26,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと笑えるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:50.26,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日能与你一起欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:53.34,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}って思える　きみと出会えた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:53.34,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我会这样想  都是因为遇见了你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:59.72,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕は　僕は　きっと幸せものだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:59.72,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我啊  一定是个幸福的人
